]Ô‚êY[4∂£¯∆m≥ÿ˛Â~∫z1˘©'bÿ…(zn({"rendered":{"html":"<p>You can run a single GCSL file without creating a workspace. This example\nchecks a small configuration and prints its computed description.</p>\n<h2 id=\"getting-started-running-a-first-program--before-you-start\">Before you start <a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#getting-started-running-a-first-program--before-you-start\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h2>\n<p>You need the following:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>The <code>gcsl</code> executable on your command search path.</li>\n<li>A writable directory for the example file.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"getting-started-running-a-first-program--create-and-run-the-file\">Create and run the file <a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#getting-started-running-a-first-program--create-and-run-the-file\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>Save the following text as <code>hello.gcsl</code>:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\" data-language=\"gcsl\"><button class=\"copy-code\" type=\"button\" data-copy-code><span class=\"copy-label\">Copy</span></button><pre><code>let component = {name = \"gcsl\"; version = \"0.1.0\"}\n\"{component.name} {component.version}\"\n</code></pre></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Check the file without running it:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\" data-language=\"sh\"><button class=\"copy-code\" type=\"button\" data-copy-code><span class=\"copy-label\">Copy</span></button><pre><code><span class=\"hl-source hl-shell hl-bash\"><span class=\"hl-meta hl-function-call hl-shell\"><span class=\"hl-variable hl-function hl-shell\">gcsl</span></span><span class=\"hl-meta hl-function-call hl-arguments hl-shell\"> check hello.gcsl</span>\n</span></code></pre></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Run the file:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\" data-language=\"sh\"><button class=\"copy-code\" type=\"button\" data-copy-code><span class=\"copy-label\">Copy</span></button><pre><code><span class=\"hl-source hl-shell hl-bash\"><span class=\"hl-meta hl-function-call hl-shell\"><span class=\"hl-variable hl-function hl-shell\">gcsl</span></span><span class=\"hl-meta hl-function-call hl-arguments hl-shell\"> run hello.gcsl</span>\n</span></code></pre></div>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"getting-started-running-a-first-program--check-the-result\">Check the result <a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#getting-started-running-a-first-program--check-the-result\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h2>\n<p>The check reports <code>no problems in 1 file checked</code> on standard error. The\nrun prints the string contents on standard output:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\" data-language=\"text\"><button class=\"copy-code\" type=\"button\" data-copy-code><span class=\"copy-label\">Copy</span></button><pre><code>gcsl 0.1.0\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>A file whose result is <code>{}</code>, the empty record, prints nothing. Diagnostics\ngo to standard error. See <code>gcsl(1)</code> for exit statuses and output modes.</p>\n<h2 id=\"getting-started-running-a-first-program--trying-expressions-interactively\">Trying expressions interactively <a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#getting-started-running-a-first-program--trying-expressions-interactively\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h2>\n<p>Run <code>gcsl</code> without arguments to open the REPL. Enter <code>let n = 21</code>, then\n<code>n * 2</code> on the next line. The second line prints <code>42 : Int</code>. Each input is\none line; separate several items on that line with semicolons. Press\n<strong>Ctrl+D</strong> to leave the session.</p>\n","toc":[{"level":2,"id":"getting-started-running-a-first-program--before-you-start","title":"Before you start","number":null},{"level":2,"id":"getting-started-running-a-first-program--create-and-run-the-file","title":"Create and run the file","number":null},{"level":2,"id":"getting-started-running-a-first-program--check-the-result","title":"Check the result","number":null},{"level":2,"id":"getting-started-running-a-first-program--trying-expressions-interactively","title":"Trying expressions interactively","number":null}],"has_mermaid":false,"dangling":[],"warnings":[],"broken":[]},"images":[],"links":{"pages":[],"anchors":[]},"refs":null}